{"id":"n62096-1-7","stage":1,"title":"자신 · 自身","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62096-1-7-1","ko":"내가 화장한 게 그렇게 이상해?","zh":"我化了妆有那么奇怪吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"화장한","meaning":"化妆","explanation":"화장하다：化妆；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"화장하다","audio":"/audio/64e98e4ef4c79595f4f6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87597","senseId":"1","lemma":"화장하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"게","meaning":"表示对某事的确信或强调。","explanation":"것：表示对某事的确信或强调。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"5","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이상해?","meaning":"奇怪，古怪","explanation":"이상하다：奇怪，古怪；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"이상하다","audio":"/audio/8ccfeb4ba665917849ed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71167","senseId":"2","lemma":"이상하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"64e98e4ef4c79595","term":"화장하다","zh":"化妆","audio":"/audio/64e98e4ef4c79595f4f6.mp3","entryId":"87597","definition":"涂抹化妆品把脸部装饰得更美。","pronunciation":["화장하다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示对某事的确信或强调。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示对某事的确信或强调。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"f